OL,3,CBoy thrown from balcony in Tate Modern
OL,4,Chas 'smile back on his face', say
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,FA boy thrown from the viewing balcony
OL,8,Fin the Tate Modern art gallery has a
OL,9,F"smile back on his face" after being
OL,10,Fdischarged from hospital, his family
OL,11,Fhave said.
OL,13,FThe French youngster was six when he
OL,14,Fwas badly hurt in an attack by then-
OL,15,Fteenager Jonty Bravery at the London
OL,16,Fattraction in 2019.
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@XO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/8
