PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785847717
OL,3,CBoy thrown from balcony in Tate Modern
OL,4,Chas 'smile back on his face', say
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,FThey said: "We wanted to let you know
OL,8,Fthat our little knight has finally
OL,9,Fleft the hospital!
OL,11,F"His hospital stay was kept as short
OL,12,Fas possible because, despite our daily
OL,13,Fpresence and encouragement, our son
OL,14,Fwas becoming deeply disheartened and
OL,15,Fkept asking when he could go back to
OL,16,Fclass and see his friends.
OL,26,@oD@LOUsD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/8
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785847717
OL,3,CBoy thrown from balcony in Tate Modern
OL,4,Chas 'smile back on his face', say
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,F"It was a great joy for him to return
OL,8,Fto school shortly before the summer
OL,9,Fholidays; since the lessons were well-
OL,10,Ftailored to his needs and challenges,
OL,11,Fhe was able to start learning again,
OL,12,Fand reuniting with his teachers and
OL,13,Fclassmates put a smile back on his
OL,14,Fface."
OL,16,FIn April this year, his family
OL,17,Freported that his recovery had taken a
OL,18,F"sad step backwards", but this newest
OL,19,Fmessage appeared to be a lot more
OL,20,Fpositive.
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@FO]zD@AOUzD@TO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/8
