OL,3,CBoy thrown from balcony in Tate Modern
OL,4,Chas 'smile back on his face', say
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FThe GoFundMe page was set up by nurse
OL,13,FVicky Diplacto, from Surrey, whose own
OL,14,Fbrother was paralysed in an incident
OL,15,Foverseas.
OL,17,FThe crowd-funding initiative, which
OL,18,Faims to cover the medical costs of the
OL,19,Finjured French boy's family, has so
OL,20,Ffar raised more than #500,000.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/8
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785847717
OL,3,CBoy thrown from balcony in Tate Modern
OL,4,Chas 'smile back on his face', say
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,FThe boy continues to undergo intensive
OL,8,Frehabilitation, including
OL,9,Fphysiotherapy, speech therapy and
OL,10,Fneuropsychology.
OL,12,FTo celebrate the end of his hospital
OL,13,Ftreatment, his family are treating him
OL,14,Fto a tandem paragliding flight, and a
OL,15,Fseaside getaway with friends.
OL,17,FHe also plans to resume his adaptive
OL,18,Fswimming lessons along with maths
OL,19,Ftutoring to catch up on the school he
OL,20,Fhas missed.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/8
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785847717
OL,3,CBoy thrown from balcony in Tate Modern
OL,4,Chas 'smile back on his face', say
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,FHis family said: "It will certainly be
OL,8,Fa busy summer. We are going to try to
OL,9,Ffully recharge his batteries (and our
OL,10,Fown) before the start of the school
OL,11,Fyear, and to get back to a family
OL,12,Froutine as normal as possible."
OL,14,FBravery, now 24, was in supported
OL,15,Faccommodation at the time of the
OL,16,Fattack but allowed out unsupervised.
OL,18,FHe intended to select and kill
OL,19,Fsomeone, a court was later told.
OL,26,@oD@ROUtD@_O]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/8
