FL,376,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785847717
OL,3,CBoy thrown from balcony in Tate Modern
OL,4,Chas 'smile back on his face', say
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,FBravery, who was 17 at the time,
OL,8,Fpleaded guilty to attempted murder and
OL,9,Fwas handed a life sentence with a
OL,10,Fminimum term of 15 years.
OL,12,FHe was back in court earlier this
OL,13,Fyear, as he was jailed for 16 weeks
OL,14,Fafter he was found guilty of
OL,15,Fassaulting two nurses at Broadmoor, a
OL,16,Fhigh-security psychiatric hospital in
OL,17,FBerkshire, in September 2024.
OL,19,FIn 2020, he was given a 14-week jail
OL,20,Fsentence after admitting to attacking
OL,21,Fstaff at the same hospital.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G8/8
